            <title>[IGNITE-2435] Integration with Mesos doesn&apos;t work with limited access to internet</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-2435</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Ignite Mesos integration doesn&apos;t work behind a firewall. Need to make all external resources will customizable and avoid unnecessary accesses to web.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
