                            <comment id="15126312" author="ntikhonov" created="Mon, 1 Feb 2016 14:43:11 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Added new IGNITE_PACKAGE_PATH property. The property allows set path to local Apache Ignite archive which will be run on slaves node.   &lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15186793" author="dmagda" created="Wed, 9 Mar 2016 09:03:41 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=ntikhonov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;ntikhonov&quot;&gt;ntikhonov&lt;/a&gt;, can the changes done as a part of this ticket be merged to the master?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15270487" author="sboikov" created="Wed, 4 May 2016 11:12:50 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Nikolay, I reviewed changes, please add some javadoc for ClusterProperties, otherwise it is not clear when packageUrl or packagePath should be used.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Thanks!&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15270770" author="vsidorova" created="Wed, 4 May 2016 14:57:38 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Integration with Mesos works good with new parameter. Nikolay, please, update &quot;Mesos deployment&quot; documentation &lt;a href=&quot;https://apacheignite.readme.io/docs/mesos-deployment&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://apacheignite.readme.io/docs/mesos-deployment&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15275994" author="dmagda" created="Mon, 9 May 2016 06:16:39 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Can this ticket be closed?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
